{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "c219df0c65ad8e445caea5c8a96f847c02a85750d2b4c1414b128f02b1cf2c1f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、見てください～♪\nゆらゆら～、ふわふわ～。とっても可愛いです～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快看快看～♪\n摇摇晃晃～，轻飘飘～。非常可爱呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dee3b11db9edd2b39a4dbb1a198439d3e2c6f737a47504481cb23373a19c3957", "ja": "おお！　よく似合ってるじゃないか。\n美也らしい感じがして、すごくいいな。", "zh": "哦！很适合你嘛。\n很有美也的感觉，我觉得特别好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "ef85fcdcbb36dc688ad16c99fb0801328e85f149369d0970c03ebd8b4c5cf999", "ja": "私らしい……。{$P$}さんは\nどのあたりが私らしいと思ったんですか～？", "zh": "很有我的风格……是吗……。{$P$}先生觉得哪些地方很有我的风格呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4c4c5b80bc6f3c13ee7a58c0083b3e90f7853fe887ebdcd5eb1e32122ecf9c4c", "ja": "美也の雰囲気が衣装にマッチしてると思ったんだ。\nリゾートでのんびりする感じとかピッタリだなって。", "zh": "我觉得美也的气质和这套服装很搭。像是在度假胜地悠闲放松的感觉，特别合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "c5a7f7e4b512f487155108ba4ddcf922a955a650f154981ee1191082f9045acf", "ja": "ふむふむ、なるほど～。\nリゾートでくつろぐ感じですか～。", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此～。\n是那种在度假胜地放松的感觉吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "a3dea27780a8dba472539fa3b9428cc89a4df06b13fafd119928508a77c60fbf", "ja": "では早速、リゾートに行ってみましょう～。\nちなみに来週は……。", "zh": "那我们这就去度假村看看吧～  \n顺便说一下，下周……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1006_p", "source_sha256": "961e520e097a0efaf6df62e2e0af3e8da5d3cf7ba031a998d693f2de9c768573", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと待ってくれ！\n気持ちは嬉しいけど、さすがに急すぎるかな……。", "zh": "等、等一下！\n你的心意我很高兴，但这也实在太突然了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee5a9c1b3789aa50e63640383154a1a882bedb0d09d525e5f5078e4df11f42ba", "ja": "そうですか～。衣装のせいか、\nちょっと気持ちが焦ってしまったかもしれませんね。", "zh": "这样啊～。也许是因为穿着这身服装，不知不觉有些着急起来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36fa97f2d5eedd6980e0a571c29f38677da4808a4713dd3b6f448f577ff4cca8", "ja": "ははっ。その気持ちはわかるよ。\n水着を着たら、遊びの予定を立てたくなるもんな。", "zh": "哈哈，我能理解你的心情。穿上泳装后，就会忍不住想安排出去玩的计划嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1009_p", "source_sha256": "394a713c778f58b3d9fb64cec955ea2391e4e94220df529198812aeaaac19c1e", "ja": "すぐは無理だけど。\nちゃんと予定を考えてるから待っててもらえるか？", "zh": "虽然不能马上实现。\n不过我正在认真安排计划，可以请你等一等吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "830b7d208777b49af94b715a5a7114bef41c56dce21504dc4a769d82dee2320f", "ja": "いえいえ、大丈夫です～。リゾートに行けないなら、\nリゾートを持ってきてしまいましょう～♪", "zh": "不不，没关系的～。既然去不了度假胜地，\n那就把度假胜地搬过来好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a931a37e5ef281ee2d4c354ee1f72e2a10547c1033ed702872347f8669ee4b2d", "ja": "リゾートを、持ってくる……？", "zh": "把度假胜地带过来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "365bd0d3ef6a3cbc8516b57b66d45f70f8cb71f36de42d55127109d615b2be35", "ja": "はい～。劇場の中に、南国のお花をたくさん飾って\n陽気な音楽とトロピカルなジュースを用意して……。", "zh": "没错～。在剧场里装饰上许多南国的鲜花，再准备好欢快的音乐和热带果汁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "46378c7b01321a9365533e2bdecb7d33fb8af48a84be031fe1a4232e5f5f3484", "ja": "むふふ、『劇場リゾート』の出来上がりです。そして\nこの衣装を着たら、もっとリゾート気分になれるかと。", "zh": "呵呵呵，“剧场度假胜地”就完成啦。而且\n我觉得穿上这套服装，就能更有度假的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ee49658f6c829dc1a4e6fcd6eed3d5c913d71b6ca719cb4dbbb99158f7023bb5", "ja": "なるほどな。劇場全体で、となると難しいけど。\n控室くらいならできるかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此。要把整个剧场都布置成那样确实很难，不过要是只有休息室的话，说不定能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cfaf5a6aab36bc5b93f047e98dc95faf656864d9c1fbefad2552d9da832284f4", "ja": "まあ、海は持ってこられないけど。\nみんなと一緒に気分を味わうことはできそうだ。", "zh": "不过，虽然不能把大海搬过来。\n但应该能和大家一起体会那种氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "5846da64195c447e59571c7b4afbf068f9bcb254c614ce34a84b6e4b12f6b3da", "ja": "味わう……。\nおお～、その手がありましたか～♪", "zh": "体验……\n噢～原来还有这个办法呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "036f39fddce2f1a38483166ab3ad686b8560a8acdc62902a8cdba21462bbcea0", "ja": "フルーツやアイスを用意して、\nもっともっと、リゾートに近づけちゃいましょう～。", "zh": "准备好水果和冰淇淋，让这里变得更像度假村吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a93d78d5c2a100d62821faa0dc681d9ff273fb94bcfc15944a28548944191516", "ja": "ははっ。考えてるだけで、楽しくなってきたな。\n美也が考えた『劇場リゾート化計画』、面白そうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，光是想想就觉得越来越开心了。\n美也构思的《剧场度假村化计划》，听起来很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "49fdcaca818774021e14bdeb7ecc6af85ce847b0e0a49b6b26788b72aee04004", "ja": "はい～。私もこの衣装で、\nリゾートムードを盛り上げちゃいますよ～♪", "zh": "没错～我也要穿上这身服装，让度假村的气氛更加热闹哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "4fb09e7205e416f4bafc6612195a274c4e176c564d83b463237d7c428531298f", "ja": "でも{$P$}さん。\nこの計画のことは、秘密にしてくださいね～？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生。\n这个计划要替我保密哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "7ee19246a1787cee787a8a70d34b65ee624b6e65341e54a7fc18f0f07b1a739d", "ja": "リゾートに行った時のワクワクを、\nみんなにも感じてほしいですから。むふふ♪", "zh": "因为我也想让大家感受到去度假胜地时的兴奋与期待。唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0564_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e546a4495b8f2a410d319414cc8ba2f09c28c3feb6adf4ab7dbb55f43dfb086c", "ja": "（その後、一日限定で計画を実行した。\n劇場のみんなは大喜び。美也も一緒に楽しんでいた）", "zh": "（之后，计划仅限一天执行。剧场的大家都非常开心，美也玩得很尽兴。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
